{"answer":null,"company_tags":["nccl","groups"],"concept_id":"nccl-group-start-end-batching","content_sha256":"sha256:eca269b2012e0b706511233e05ec196f3097f0e597a556535ccb293661624ebb","correct_option_ids":["a"],"created_at":1789959334.4917061,"domain":"operator-development","explanation":"group 调用把包在 GroupStart/GroupEnd 之间的多个 NCCL 操作(如多个 send+recv,或跨多通信器的调用)聚合为一个批次一起进入调度。这对成对的 P2P 尤其重要:单独逐个阻塞式调用可能互相等待导致死锁,聚合后可一并处理,也降低启动开销。","id":"q-op-mag6-nccl-group-start-end-batching-001","options":[{"id":"a","text":"把中间的多次 NCCL 调用聚合成一次组操作,既能避免多对 send/recv 相互等待造成的死锁,又能合并下发以减少开销/提升重叠"},{"id":"b","text":"强制所有 GPU 立即 device 级同步"},{"id":"c","text":"切换通信协议为 TCP"},{"id":"d","text":"仅用于打印通信日志"}],"prompt":"ncclGroupStart() / ncclGroupEnd() 的主要作用是?","review_state":null,"rubric":null,"schema_version":"question/v1","skill":"mechanism","source_refs":[{"kind":"official_docs","title":"NCCL: Group Calls","url":"https://docs.nvidia.com/deeplearning/nccl/user-guide/docs/usage/groups.html"}],"status":"enabled","topic":"nccl","type":"single_choice","wiki_refs":[]}
